I also explicitly built the pack around the strongest thing already present in AgentSEOLab: it treats agent actions and controlled outcomes as evidence, not just what models claim they prefer. Its canonical rules already require frozen intent, AB/BA controls, fresh sessions, model provenance and family-level replication. That becomes DomainArena's methodological moat rather than being thrown away during the product pivot.

